      "message": "I will pass the passive flag in the BTA layer using the `bta_av_rc_create -\u003e AVRC_Open` flow. In addition, since the passive flag checks in `AVRC_Open` will be removed, I will also update CL 3995735. Specifically, in `system/profile/avrcp/connection_handler.cc`, before `AvrcpConnect` calls `avrc_-\u003eOpen`, I will add a new check in the case where both source and sink are enabled to determine whether the passive flag is required.",
